# Q6 - Product price history
# How the price changes over time given a specific product

PREFIX ocel: <https://graphbench.org/ocel#>
PREFIX om: <https://graphbench.org/order-management#>
PREFIX obj: <https://graphbench.org/order-management/data/object/>

SELECT ?time ?product ?value
WHERE{
    VALUES ?product { obj:iPad%20Air }
    ?product om:hasPrice ?price .
    ?price	ocel:time ?time ;
    		ocel:value ?value .
}
ORDER BY ?time 